1
00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,730
What's the big deal?
You've done this before.

2
00:00:02,901 --> 00:00:05,571
(Howard:)No, I haven't. Look.

3
00:00:06,738 --> 00:00:10,408
(Howard:)-I'm sorry. I'm a fraud. He's a fraud.
-We're both frauds.

4
00:00:10,575 --> 00:00:13,745
(Howard:)-Yeah, I think I covered that.
-Well, I was summing up.

5
00:00:15,831 --> 00:00:19,541
(Howard:)We're not goth. We're just guys.

6
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,630
(Raj:)Very, very smart guys.

7
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:23,587
(Bethany:)So you were totally scamming us?

8
00:00:24,381 --> 00:00:25,761
(Penny:)Yes.

9
00:00:25,924 --> 00:00:28,554
(Howard:)And I wouldn't blame you
if you walked out of here...

10
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:31,049
(Howard:)...and never wanted to see us again.

11
00:00:31,221 --> 00:00:34,761
(Howard:)Unless, of course, our bold honesty
has suddenly made us attractive.

12
00:00:34,933 --> 00:00:36,763
Huh? Huh? Anything?

13
00:00:39,438 --> 00:00:41,268
(Bethany:)I'm leaving.

14
00:00:44,943 --> 00:00:46,573
(Sarah:)I'm leaving too.

15
00:00:46,737 --> 00:00:48,947
(Second girl:)Not that anyone cares.

16
00:00:55,954 --> 00:01:00,024
(Raj:)When we tell this story,
let's end it differently.

